NOTE ON THE DATA ITSELF

All cases are synthetic — generated, not collected from real experiments.
They contain no personal data and no observations from any production system.
Two properties documented in README.md affect how the corpus may legitimately
be used for measurement: 129 of 660 cases name their mechanism in plain text
inside contract.notes, and in 66 cases the deciding evidence is absent from
data.csv entirely. Read that section before reporting any numbers measured
on this corpus.
